{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52111","headline":"嘲道士李荣（题拟） · 静泰","name":"嘲道士李荣（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李荣乌黮，何异蛣蜣。\n先师米贼，汝亦不良。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第五十二册释道宣撰《集古今佛道论衡》卷丁）（按：此诗爲显庆五年八月二人辩论时作。\n文长不录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"静泰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}